 {'faction':'FAC-03','work':'Compare route reports, escort finite convoys and rescue people without powerful sponsors.','temptation':'Keep a secret to preserve confidence, or promise a schedule that cannot survive a rescue stop.','correction':'Sela discloses uncertainty and her own role in the flood-funding agreement. Capacity stays visible.'},
