 {'id':'EV-06','claim':'Brakka’s raid is independent','first_audience':'S1E07-09','observable':'Strained outside routes concentrate supplies; raiders choose the opportunity.','innocent_possibility':'A traded crate or paid message does not prove one faction commands another.','proof':'Separate objectives, route observations and accounts establish the band’s decision.','proves_not':'No all-controlling villain alliance is revealed.','reveal':'The season-one raid fails without resolving every wider antagonist.'},
