D['season_one_ledger']=[
 {'episode':e['number'],'title':e['title'],'baseline_plot':e['plot'],'character_turn':e['character_turn'],'pressure':p,'allowed_audience_knowledge':k}
 for e,p,k in zip(W['seasons'][0]['episodes'],[
 'Ordinary life functions. Only two small pauses.','Conflicting reports create a practical rescue inquiry.','Local knowledge complicates the old friendship.','A message conflicts with the physical world.','Recognition and rescue collide.','A true past rescue becomes a present moral argument.','An exclusive supply offer and an independent raider opportunity develop.','The outer public district evacuates; inner physical protection holds.','Four complementary hero roles and residents’ expertise complete the retreat.','Recovery addresses missing travelers and the local raid; outward work is chosen.'
 ],[
 'No villain names, exterior cutaways, attack, sinister voiceover or proof of a conspiracy.','There are missing people and uncertain information; no automatic criminal attribution.','Nix is an old friend; leadership of Glass Thread remains unproved.','Someone issued harmful guidance; exact culpability still needs corroboration.','Nix’s connection becomes clear; the best portable evidence is lost during rescue.','Veyra’s funding is established; Sela admits omission.','Residents decide with the relevant facts. Brakka is not Veyra’s subordinate.','A raid and confused outside messages are separate problems. No remote gate opening.','Nix makes one limited repair and escapes fuller accountability.','Immediate rescue and raid are resolved. Broader mysteries invite a freely chosen next journey.'
 ])]
